<article><body><sec id="s"><p id="p">FixtureTransporter apparent Km = 12 uM for S.</p><p id="conditions">FixtureTransporter uses substrate S in whole cells and a whole-cell system; initial uptake follows kinetic curve A with Michaelis-Menten response. The test substrate is 8 uM; the reference substrate is 32 uM. A different preparation uses proteoliposomes and a vesicle system with kinetic curve B.</p></sec></body></article>